<title>UK: Russian Duma to debate production sharing March 20.</title>
<headline>Russian Duma to debate production sharing March 20.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian State Duma, the lower house of parliament, is scheduled to discuss reforms to the law on Production Sharing Agreements next Thursday, March 20, the Duma's Deputy Chairman said on Friday.</p>
<p>Artur Chilingarov made the remarks while addressing a conference here on Trade and Investment Opportunities in the Russian Oil Industry.</p>
<p>Foreign investors are looking for sweeping reforms to the existing law before committing funds to energy projects in Russia.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714</p>
</text>
